v 3
d cxchangelog: rebuild a cross-wave survey codebook from a long-format crosswalk
d
d A survey that runs for years accumulates reworded questions, added
d items, and dropped items. cxchangelog reads a long-format crosswalk
d of the instrument (one row per concept per wave, in .xlsx or .csv)
d and regenerates the codebook: an items-by-wave grid of question
d wording, per-wave counts of what was added, removed, and reworded,
d and a diff against a frozen prior vintage of the crosswalk. The
d data in memory are preserved and restored untouched.
d
d Requires: Stata 16.0 or newer
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260706
d
f cxchangelog.ado
f cxchangelog.sthlp
